# Permit or Pew
#
# The game is plain files (no build step, no packages), so very little needs ignoring. This list keeps
# machine leftovers and anything secret out of the repository.
#
# NOT ignored on purpose, because they are part of the project and its evidence:
#   specs/, .specify/ (the constitution and Spec Kit templates), .claude/skills/ (the Spec Kit skills),
#   data/, assets/ (the card image), tests/, ARCADE.md, README.md.
# Spec Kit keeps its own machine-local files out of git in .specify/.gitignore, so they are not repeated here.

# Operating system and editor leftovers
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Python bytecode caches (serve.py is run as a script, but this keeps them out if it is ever imported)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Node packages, in case npm tooling is added later (the game itself has no dependencies)
node_modules/

# Local secrets and logs. The game needs no keys or accounts, but these should never be committed.
.env
.env.*
*.log

# Personal Claude Code settings for one machine (permissions you approved). The shared Spec Kit skills in
# .claude/skills are committed; only this local file is ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
